ess steel appliances and a gas fireplace complete the family room. Upstairs, the primary bedroom offers a spa-like ensuite with a jetted tub and private shower. Enjoy custom blinds, central A/C, new furnace with transferrable warranty, and newer basement carpet. Outside, an aggregate driveway fits 4 vehicles, an oversized, heated double garage with floor drain. Steps to walkways, a park, school, and a man-made lake. A rare combination of quality, location, and upgrades. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$685,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,186 sq ft"],["Year built","2005"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Chambery"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5X6J3"],["MLS® number","E4513121"],["Listed","October 15, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Basement",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 4","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 5","Basement",""],["Laundry room","Main level",""]],"courtesy":"Mo Taliani, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"chambery","area":"northwest-edmonton"}